Dataset NameTransformation ActionBusiness Purpose / JustificationSwiftLog_OrdersParsed OrderDate into Date, Year, Quarter, Month, and MonthNoEnables time-intelligence reporting and chronological timeline filtering.SwiftLog_OrdersTrimmed & Cleaned Status valuesEnsures uniform status categories (Delivered, Pending, Cancelled).SwiftLog_ShipmentsAdded Delivery_Status conditional column (if [DelayDays] > 0 then "Delayed" else "On Time")Classifies shipments into binary Delayed or On Time performance brackets directly on the shipment record without needing to merge external tables.SwiftLog_InventoryApplied Remove Duplicates across all columnsEliminates the 3 exact identical duplicate rows (W05-P010, W15-P021, W02-P023) to prevent double-counting raw records.SwiftLog_InventoryGrouped by WarehouseID & ProductID (Sum Stock)Aggregates all remaining stock movement logs into a unified snapshot of current stock levels per SKU per warehouse facility.SwiftLog_ProductsStandardized text casing on CategoryPrevents category duplication caused by inconsistent capitalization across catalog items.SwiftLog_CustomersTrimmed and cleaned City namesEliminates trailing whitespace irregularities in regional reporting across Nigerian commercial hubs.SwiftLog_EmployeesVerified EmployeeID and WarehouseID data typesEnsures clean referential alignment with warehouse distribution nodes.
